{"title": "Infernal Sight", "pageid": 28355, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Infernal_Sight", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Infernal Sight</b> is a passive feature that lets the wearer see in normal darkness, and provides immunity against blindness.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You can see in magical<sup><i>[<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Bugs\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup> and ordinary darkness up to a range of 12 m (40 ft). You cannot be <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blinded\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\">Blinded</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helldusk_Helmet\" title=\"Helldusk Helmet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4d/Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Helldusk_Helmet\" title=\"Helldusk Helmet\">Helldusk Helmet</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Infernal Sight prevents all conditions in the <span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blinded\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(status_group)\" title=\"Blinded (status group)\">Blinded</a></span> status group, in addition to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blinded\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\">Blinded</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Infernal Sight does not see through <a href=\"/wiki/Darkness_(cloud)\" title=\"Darkness (cloud)\">magical darkness</a> and does not provide the cone of light that is otherwise present with the Darkvision effect from a different source, such as the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision_(spell)\" title=\"Darkvision (spell)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Darkvision_spell_Icon.webp/20px-Darkvision_spell_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Darkvision_spell_Icon.webp/30px-Darkvision_spell_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Darkvision_spell_Icon.webp/40px-Darkvision_spell_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Darkvision\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Darkvision_spell_Icon.webp/20px-Darkvision_spell_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/01/Darkvision_spell_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision_(spell)\" title=\"Darkvision (spell)\">Darkvision</a> spell, an <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Darkvision\" title=\"Elixir of Darkvision\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/ELX_Elixir_of_Darkvision_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Elixir_of_Darkvision_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/ELX_Elixir_of_Darkvision_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Elixir_of_Darkvision_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/ELX_Elixir_of_Darkvision_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-ELX_Elixir_of_Darkvision_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/ELX_Elixir_of_Darkvision_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Elixir_of_Darkvision_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a4/ELX_Elixir_of_Darkvision_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Darkvision\" title=\"Elixir of Darkvision\">Elixir of Darkvision</a>, or from having the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision\" title=\"Darkvision\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/20px-Darkvision_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/30px-Darkvision_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/40px-Darkvision_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Darkvision\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/20px-Darkvision_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision\" title=\"Darkvision\">Darkvision</a> passive innately via <a href=\"/wiki/Race\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Race\">race</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201102\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.057 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.064 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2447/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20888/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8310/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.029/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 980216/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   56.368      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   56.368      1 -total\n 31.67%   17.853      2 Template:SmCond\n 16.63%    9.374      2 Template:Item_icon\n 16.13%    9.090      5 Template:Icon_text\n 15.95%    8.989      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 14.81%    8.348      4 Template:Icon_link\n 14.77%    8.328     22 Template:Trim\n 12.84%    7.240      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 11.68%    6.586      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28355-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201102 and revision id 371941. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}